'''Aquarium''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable in the [[Summer Event 2025|2025 Summer Event]] by unboxing it from the [[2025 Summer Box]] for 800 [[Beach Balls]] {{Currency|Beach Ball}}. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

== Appearance ==
This blade shows a colorful underwater coral reef scene, with clownfish, yellow tangs, and various coral species. The vibrant orange, yellow, green, and pink hues really stand out against the deep blue background. The guard has a dark reddish tone, while the handle subtly continues the reef color palette.  

== Trivia ==
* It has a [[Aquarium (Gun)|matching gun]] under the same name.

